A_269 - It's important to understand the concepts of subjectivity, relationship, interaction, and objectivity. For example, with a rock or a stone, you can close your eyes and feel happy, sad, amused, angry (subjectivity), or you can love, appreciate, despise, insult (relationship)... or you can lick, paint, sculpt, caress, throw, boil, freeze (interaction), or you can weigh, measure, chemically analyze, describe based on the sciences in force (objectivity)... The concept of objectivity was taught to me by my friend Michele Rispoli.